# Throughline Coordinate MVP — environment
# Everything runs with NO configuration. All values below are optional.

# --- Optional AI explanation layer -------------------------------------------
# The MVP ships a deterministic explanation/drafting engine and needs no API key.
# If you want the natural-language "why" and drafted actions to be generated by
# a model instead, set these. The model is used ONLY to phrase what the
# deterministic engine already detected — it never decides severity, never
# invents evidence, and must answer "Insufficient information available" when
# the supplied context is thin.
THROUGHLINE_AI_EXPLANATIONS=off        # off | on
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
THROUGHLINE_AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- Demo identity ----------------------------------------------------------
# The MVP has no real auth. Pick the role the UI starts in.
THROUGHLINE_DEFAULT_ROLE=coordinator  # coordinator | oversight
